{"id":"e46af049d0ea6278","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-inseparable-box-witness.md","title":"An Inseparable Witness for a Negative Box","display":"lem-inseparable-box-witness — An Inseparable Witness for a Negative Box","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-inseparable-box-witness","aliases":["89-lem-inseparable-box-witness"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-inseparable-box-witness — An Inseparable Witness for a Negative Box","depends_on":["[[89-df-inseparable-pair]]","[[89-lem-k4-dotted-box]]","[[89-lem-lob-implies-4]]","[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-inseparable-box-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-inseparable-box-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-inseparable-box-witness — An Inseparable Witness for a Negative Box"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18a7d6d6f6148b37\" href=\"?note=18a7d6d6f6148b37\" title=\"89-df-inseparable-pair\">89-df-inseparable-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f40c827a0ffac0b4\" href=\"?note=f40c827a0ffac0b4\" title=\"89-lem-k4-dotted-box\">89-lem-k4-dotted-box</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7c3acbd110a662db\" href=\"?note=7c3acbd110a662db\" title=\"89-lem-lob-implies-4\">89-lem-lob-implies-4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7c0e4d58dc068222\" href=\"?note=7c0e4d58dc068222\" title=\"89-lem-normal-box-lifting\">89-lem-normal-box-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\">\\(w\\in\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box E\\in X\">\\(\\Box E\\in X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box E\\notin w\">\\(\\Box E\\notin w\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为同一两语言结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为下文定义的有限见证集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}box\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nT\\coloneqq\\{\\Box H,H:\\Box H\\in w\\}\n\\cup\\{\\Box E,\\neg E\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}box\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nT\\coloneqq\\{\\Box H,H:\\Box H\\in w\\}\n\\cup\\{\\Box E,\\neg E\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 120–121；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>极大性及投影一致性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box E\\in w\">\\(\\neg\\Box E\\in w\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可分离，选含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的一侧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>，把分离公式必要时取否定，使共同语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i\\to B\">\\(T_i\\to B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{1-i}\\to\\neg B\">\\(T_{1-i}\\to\\neg B\\)</span> 可证。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_i\">\\(w_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_{1-i}\">\\(w_{1-i}\\)</span> 中全部盒内式的有限合取；盒提升使对应盒集的合取等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box H,\\Box I\">\\(\\Box H,\\Box I\\)</span>。\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 不在另一侧语言，第一条改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+H\\land\\neg B\\to(\\Box E\\to E)\">\\(\\Box^+H\\land\\neg B\\to(\\Box E\\to E)\\)</span>。必然化、4、K 与 Löb 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box H\\land\\Box\\neg B\\to\\Box E\">\\(\\Box H\\land\\Box\\neg B\\to\\Box E\\)</span>；第二条得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box I\\to\\Box\\neg B\">\\(\\Box I\\to\\Box\\neg B\\)</span>。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_i\">\\(w_i\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box\\neg B\">\\(\\neg\\Box\\neg B\\)</span>，另一侧蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\neg B\">\\(\\Box\\neg B\\)</span>，构成共同语言的分离，矛盾。\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 属共同语言，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=B\\to(\\Box E\\to E)\">\\(J=B\\to(\\Box E\\to E)\\)</span>。第二条给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+I\\to J\">\\(\\Box^+I\\to J\\)</span>，提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box I\\to\\Box J\">\\(\\Box I\\to\\Box J\\)</span>。第一条则给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+H\\land J\\to(\\Box E\\to E)\">\\(\\Box^+H\\land J\\to(\\Box E\\to E)\\)</span>；必然化、4、K 与 Löb 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box H\\land\\Box J\\to\\Box E\">\\(\\Box H\\land\\Box J\\to\\Box E\\)</span>。于是两侧分别蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box J\">\\(\\neg\\Box J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box J\">\\(\\Box J\\)</span>，仍分离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>，矛盾。两个分支中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box E\">\\(\\neg\\Box E\\)</span> 均在含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的投影，所用新分离公式的字母全属共同语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq X^{\\pm}\">\\(T\\subseteq X^{\\pm}\\)</span> 由子公式闭包。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-inseparable-pair","status":"resolved","id":"18a7d6d6f6148b37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-inseparable-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-k4-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"f40c827a0ffac0b4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-k4-dotted-box]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-lob-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"7c3acbd110a662db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-lob-implies-4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"w\\in\\mathrm{MaxInsep}_{A,C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box E\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box E\\notin w","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}inseparable\\text{-}box\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nT\\coloneqq\\{\\Box H,H:\\Box H\\in w\\}\n\\cup\\{\\Box E,\\neg E\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Insep}_{A,C}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box E\\in w","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},